4"}, "ξυνήων": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "as Adj., the salt on the common table, Alex.Aet.3.15"}, "ξυρίς": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "gladwyn, Iris foetidissima, Dsc.4.22"}, "ξυστίς": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "robe of rich and soft material; = Epich.97, Diph.52. fabric, such as fustian, plush, velvet, etc. ; cf. IV, 3 : for the semantic relation between and , and cf. ONorse skrúd 'some kind of textile fabric', skrúd-kloedi …"}, "ξῦστρον": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "scythe fixed to chariots, D.S.17.53; = BSA27.228 : condemned by Thom.Mag.p.252 R"}, "ξύφος": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "coined as etym. of EM611.8"}, "ξαίνω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "of cloth, full, dress it, Ar.Av.l.c; metaph., thresh, dub. in A.Fr.304.7 ; fret, mangle, of waves, AP6.223 , cf. 23; fretted into foam, A.R.4.1266; of bodies, mangle, lacerate, D.H.3.30; esp. of flogging, ibid. ; Plu.…"}, "ξανθίζω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "make yellow or brown, by roasting or; intr., to be yellow, LXXLe.13.30; Alciphr.Fr.5.4"}, "ξάνθιον": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "a plant used for dyeing the hair yellow"}, "ξάνθισμα": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "that which is dyed yellow, dyed hair, E.Fr.322, cf. AP5.259"}, "ξανθόω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "dye yellow, Ps.-Democr.Alch.p.52 B.:—Pass., become yellow, Dsc.1.68"}, "ξάνσις": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "wool-carding, Gloss"}, "ξεναγέτης": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "one who takes charge of guests, the hospitable Delphians, Pi.N.7.43"}, "ξεναγέω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "to be a leader of mercenaries; guide strangers, show them the sights, your work as a guide has been done excellently, Pl.Phdr.230c; one seeing the sights, ibid. ; Luc.DMort.18.1, cf. Cont.I : metaph., generally, guide…"}, "ξεναγία": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "office of command of a body of; = Ael.Tact.9.4, Arr.Tact.10.3"}, "ξενίζω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Ion. and Ep. fut. later; surprise, astonish by some strange sight, Plb.3.114.4; of strange words, Hld.6.14; Gp.2.48.2; do violence to the ordinary use of language, Simp.in Cael.679.28:—Pass., to be astonished, S.Ichn.…"}, "ξενίς": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "road leading abroad, SIG636.24"}, "ξενολογέω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "enlist foreign troops, esp. mercenaries; metaph., raise a contribution of pity, D.S.34/5.2.39"}, "ξενοφόνος": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "poet. murdering strangers; honour paid to murderers of strangers, E.IT776"}, "ξενοφύλαξ": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "in pl., magistrates charged with the protection of foreigners, Rev.Et. Gr.42.35"}, "ξενόω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Ion. make one's friend and; mostly in Pass., with fut. Med. S.Ph.303: pf. aor"}, "ξέσις": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "planing, Thphr.HP5.6.4"}, "ξέσμα": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "that which is smoothed or; abrasion, in pl., Jul.Caes.309c"}, "ξέω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "impf. Od.23.199: fut. Paul.Aeg.3.22.12; carve wood, shape by carving, Od.23.199; Simon.l.c.:—Pass., Hld.l.c"}, "ξηραίνω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "drain dry, Th.1.109; metaph., Telesp.34 H"}, "ξηρόμυρον": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "dry perfume, i.e. in cake or powder; = rosmarinum, Gloss"}, "ξιφίας": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "sword fish, Arist.HA505a18; a kind of comet , Plin.HN 2.89"}, "ξιφίζω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "dance the sword-dance, Cratin.219"}, "ξίφιον": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "or corn-flag, Gladiolus segetum, Thphr.HP6.8.1, Dsc.4.20"}, "ξίφιος": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "a fish like the Cyran.32"}, "ξόανον": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "image carved of wood, E.Ion1403; musical instrument, S.Fr.238"}, "ξυλεία": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "felling and carrying of wood; timber, Plb.3.42.3"}, "ξυλοπέδη": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "log of wood tied to the feet, Aq.Jb.13.27,33.11"}, "ξυλοπυρία": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "perh. sharpening to a point with fire, Anon.in Rh.236.8"}, "ξυλοφορέω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "carry wood, of a slave or mule; carry a stick, as the Cynics did, Luc.Pisc.24"}, "ξυνοχαρής": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "rejoicing with all alike, of Apollo, ibid"}, "ξυνόω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "cause to participate, Nonn.D.17.220:—Med., = Nearch. ap. Arr.Ind.20.4, Man.2.493"}, "ξῦσις": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "ulceration, erosion; excoriation, Aret.CD1.3"}, "ξύσμα": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "filings, shavings, Hp.Aph.7.68; lint, Erot. s.v"}, "ξυσμή": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "in pl., scratchings, i.e. critical marks in; scab, as a term of abuse, Sophr.53"}, "ξυστήρ": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "scraper, rasp, file, Hp.VC14; part of the external ear, Gal.14.701"}, "ξυστήριος": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "of or for scraping: dentist's instrument for scaling teeth, Paul.Aeg.6.28"}, "ξύστρα": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "scraper used after bathing, Hp.Nat.Mul.42; = Archig. ap. Gal.12.620"}, "ξύω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "shred, prob. in Hp.Int.37; Thphr.HP9.11.2; shape by whittling, shaving, or planing, ib.5.1.7:—Med., whittle oneself a javelin, X.l.c"}, "ξένηθεν": {"pos": "avverbio", "definition": "Ion. Adv.from abroad, Opp.H.4.153"}, "ξεινοβάκχη": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "mad for love of the stranger, of Medea, Lyc.175"}, "ξύρησις": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "shaving, Asclep. ap. Gal.12.413, Plu.2.352c, Archig. ap. Aët.6.28, Alex.Aphr.Pr.2.36; baldness, LXXIs.22.12"}, "ξυσμός": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "itching, irritation, Hp.Aph.3.31; Id.Loc.Hom.14"}, "ξυλαλόη": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "= Aët.1.131; scanned ⏑–⏑– by Heraclit. Gramm. in An.Ox.3.277"}, "ξηρόβηξ": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "dry cough, Cass.Fel.34"}, "ξυλοκύμβη": {"pos": "sostantivo",